sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant Mobile
  participant API
  participant Vision
  participant Data as Route / permitted reference data
  User->>Mobile: Grant camera consent and start
  Mobile->>Mobile: Quality gate / deduplicate frame
  Mobile->>API: Location, accuracy, heading, optional selected frame
  API->>API: Validate schema, consent, limits
  API->>Vision: Validated localization request
  Vision->>Data: Retrieve eligible candidates
  Data-->>Vision: Candidate metadata
  Vision->>Vision: Match, consistency, calibration, stability
  Vision-->>API: Estimate or abstention + evidence
  API->>API: Validate output and fuse route/GPS
  API-->>Mobile: Estimate or GPS fallback
  Mobile-->>User: One instruction or safe relocalization prompt
